ate":"2018-05-19T17:02:11.436Z"},"_updatedDate":{"$date":"2018-10-30T21:28:00.990Z"},"catagory":"Noodles & Pasta","title":"Harissa Shrimp Scampi","link-Recipes-catagory-catagory":"/Recipes/catagory/noodles-%26-pasta"},{"photo":"image://v1/577c92_6fefbd775aaa47679fc420c93529613a~mv2_d_3154_2365_s_2.jpg/3154_2365/20180329_183854.jpg","url":"http://www.theglasspantry.com/single-post/2018/04/25/Turkey-Ramen-Stir-fry","_id":"5c8e59f7-48f7-43d4-8d1f-44a87c861780","_owner":"577c92d8-55f7-4f98-88a2-d8647b1c2c9c","_createdDate":{"$date":"2018-05-03T17:12:12.886Z"},"_updatedDate":{"$date":"2018-10-30T21:27:33.001Z"},"ingredients":"<p>Ingredients</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>1 lb.&nbsp;Ground Turkey</p>\n\n<p>2 teaspoons peanut oil</p>\n\n<p>2 cakes of Dried Ramen Noodles cooked according to package directions</p>\n\n<p>1 inch knob finely minced&nbsp;Ginger</p>\n\n<p>3 large cloves minced Garlic</p>\n\n<p>2 cups shredded Cabbage</p>\n\n<p>1/2&nbsp; a White Onion</p>\n\n<p>1/2 cup Shredded Carrots</p>\n\n<p>1 can sliced Water Chestnuts sliced into large slivers</p>\n\n<p>1 small bag Bean Shoots</p>\n\n<p>1/2 of 1 small bag of Enoki Mushrooms</p>\n\n<p>2 large Green Onions sliced</p>\n\n<p>1 bunch Cilantro chopped</p>\n\n<p>1 small Serrano Chili diced</p>\n\n<p>1/4 cup fish sauce</p>\n\n<p>1 tablespoon sesame oil</p>\n\n<p>3 tablespoon soy sauce</p>","catagory":"Noodles & Pasta","instructions":"<p>Cook the noodles according to package directions.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Mix together the fish sauce, sesame oil and soy sauce then&nbsp;set it aside.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Preheat a wok to medium high.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Add a few teaspoons of peanut oil&nbsp;to the very hot wok then half of the ginger and garlic. Brown the ground turkey then add the rest of the ginger and garlic.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Now add the&nbsp;cabbage,onion, carrots&nbsp;and water chestnuts. Stir-fry 2 minutes.</p>\n\n<p>Next, add the bean shoots and the green onion then stir-fry for 1 minute.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Stir in the cooked ramen noodles and top with the stir-fry sauce. Stir-fry&nbsp;for another few minutes to incorporate the sauce and heat the noodles through.</p>","title":"Turkey Ramen Stir-fry","link-Recipes-catagory-catagory":"/Recipes/catagory/noodles-%26-pasta"},{"photo":"image://v1/577c92_a500ed3d38244476bbd882f6226c99e8~mv2_d_3148_2362_s_2.jpg/3148_2362/20180331_124045.jpg","url":"https://www.theglasspantry.com/quick-turkey-ramen-pho","_id":"ecb5b3d4-e13c-4e97-a07d-e95146e01e1a","_owner":"577c92d8-55f7-4f98-88a2-d8647b1c2c9c","_createdDate":{"$date":"2018-05-03T17:11:09.464Z"},"_updatedDate":{"$date":"2018-10-30T21:27:41.759Z"},"ingredients":"<p>Ingredients</p>\n\n<p>​</p>\n\n<p>For the Soup&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>4-6 cups Stock of your choice</p>\n\n<p>1 black cardamom Pod</p>\n\n<p>2 lime leaves (optional)</p>\n\n<p>2-3 thick slices fresh ginger</p>\n\n<p>1 or 2 Star Anise Pods</p>\n\n<p>​</p>\n\n<p>The Noodles</p>\n\n<p>1 1/2 - 3 cups Turkey Ramen Stir Fry</p>\n\n<p>​</p>\n\n<p>The Toppings</p>\n\n<p>1/2 cup chopped cilantro</p>\n\n<p>1/2 cup chopped scallion</p>\n\n<p>1 or 2 sliced Thai, Serrano or</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Jalapeno peppers</p>\n\n<p>1/2 cup torn Thai basil leaves</p>\n\n<p>1/2 package Enoki Mushrooms</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"wixGuard\">​</span></p>","catagory":"Noodles & Pasta","instructions":"<p>Method</p>\n\n<p>​</p>\n\n<p>Place the thawed&nbsp;stock into&nbsp;a pot and heat it over a medium heat setting adding the fresh ginger slices, star anise,&nbsp;a black cardamom pod and lime leaves (if using).&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Method</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"wixGuard\">​</span></p>\n\n<p>After the broth has come to a simmer allow it to simmer for 15 minutes, then turn up the heat and get it really hot about (15 minutes )while&nbsp;preparing&nbsp;the fresh herbs for the topping.</p>\n\n<p>​​</p>\n\n<p>Let the ramen warm to room temperature while heating the broth and preparing the toppings.</p>\n\n<p>​</p>\n\n<p>Place&nbsp;some of the ramen stir-fry and enoki mushrooms in a large wide bowl,&nbsp;then top with the hot broth.</p>\n\n<p>​</p>\n\n<p>Serve with the fresh herbs, chili&#39;s and lime wedges.</p>","title":"Quick Turkey Ramen Pho","link-Recipes-catagory-catagory":"/Recipes/catagory/noodles-%26-pasta"}],"dynamicUrl":"/Recipes/catagory/{catagory}","config":{"dataset":{"collection":"Recipes","pageSize":100.0,"filter":{"link-Recipes-catagory-catagory":"/Recipes/catagory/noodles-%26-pasta"},"collectionName":"Recipes","sort":[{"catagory":"asc"},{"_createdDate":"desc"}],"seoV2":true}},"totalCount":6.0,"schemas":{"Recipes":{"displayName":"Recipes","plugins":{},"allowedOperations":["patch","isReferenced","insert","save","bulkInsert","bulkUpdate","update","truncate","remove","removeReference","count","bulkPatch","find","replaceReferences","bulkRemove","insertReference","get","bulkSave","queryReferenced","distinct","aggregate"],"id":"Recipes","fields":{"photo":{"displayName":"Photo","sortable":true,"isDeleted":false,"type":"image","index":2.0},"url":{"displayName":"URL","sortable":true,"isDeleted":false,"type":"url","index":1.0},"_id":{"displayName":"ID","sortable":true,"isDeleted":false,"type":"text","index":7.0},"_owner":{"displayName":"Owner","sortable":true,"isDeleted":false,"type":"text","index":8.0},"_createdDate":{"displayName":"Created Date","sortable":true,"isDeleted":false,"type":"datetime","index":9.0},"_updatedDate":{"displayName":"Updated Date","sortable":true,"isDeleted":false,"type":"datetime","index":10.0},"ingredients":{"displayName":"Ingredients","sortable":true,"isDeleted":false,"type":"richtext","index":3.0},"catagory":{"displayName":"Catagory","sortable":true,"isDeleted":false,"type":"text","index":5.0},"instructions":{"displayName":"Instructions","sortable":true,"isDeleted":false,"type":"richtext","index":4.0},"title":{"displayName":"Title","sortable":true,"isDeleted":false,"type":"text","index":0.0},